title: "mzmlpy: Type-safe, lazy mzML reading in Python"
abstract: >-
  A type-safe Python library for lazy reading of mzML mass spectrometry files,
  including multiple compression formats, ion-mobility metadata, and
  data-independent acquisition metadata.
